{"4244880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crazy Hotel Together", "steam_appid": 4244880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have discovered a wonderful human invention they call a <strong>hotel </strong>! <br>You decide to embark on this adventure with up to four of your companions and transform your small business into a true palace.<br>Furnish your rooms to make them as cozy as possible for your guests, and upgrade your hotel by unlocking new floors and new rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful with random events that could make you lose reputation if you don’t handle them properly ! <br>So don’t wait any longer—jump into this crazy adventure with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERSONALIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and furnish your hotel to make it as welcoming as possible for your guests… but that’s not all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your hotel into a place that truly reflects you, but don’t forget to upgrade it to unlock even more customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/a79ab524b1a0e576a3da67f609afc808.poster.avif?t=1777880049\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/a79ab524b1a0e576a3da67f609afc808.webm?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/a79ab524b1a0e576a3da67f609afc808.mp4?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMANDING CLIENTELE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the expectations of even the most demanding guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want your business to thrive, you’ll need to meet the requirements of your hotel’s clients, or you may end up with a bad reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/7a1a2864c7d48c4081fe997ab6cb0520.poster.avif?t=1777880049\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/7a1a2864c7d48c4081fe997ab6cb0520.webm?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/7a1a2864c7d48c4081fe997ab6cb0520.mp4?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have built a good reputation and developed your hotel, you will be able to hire employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These loyal staff members will assist you with cleaning the rooms, allowing you to focus on expanding your hotel and welcoming your guests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/67f91965b01617e68d4898bb91850585.poster.avif?t=1777880049\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/67f91965b01617e68d4898bb91850585.webm?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/67f91965b01617e68d4898bb91850585.mp4?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>THE MORE THE MERRIER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to three of your friends! But be careful: choose your companions wisely, they might be a great help… or not !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/e0e78cea91c63b2464e96fdeeac1cd20.poster.avif?t=1777880049\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/e0e78cea91c63b2464e96fdeeac1cd20.webm?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/e0e78cea91c63b2464e96fdeeac1cd20.mp4?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have discovered a wonderful human invention they call a <strong>hotel </strong>! <br>You decide to embark on this adventure with up to four of your companions and transform your small business into a true palace.<br>Furnish your rooms to make them as cozy as possible for your guests, and upgrade your hotel by unlocking new floors and new rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful with random events that could make you lose reputation if you don’t handle them properly ! <br>So don’t wait any longer—jump into this crazy adventure with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERSONALIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and furnish your hotel to make it as welcoming as possible for your guests… but that’s not all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your hotel into a place that truly reflects you, but don’t forget to upgrade it to unlock even more customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/a79ab524b1a0e576a3da67f609afc808.poster.avif?t=1777880049\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/a79ab524b1a0e576a3da67f609afc808.webm?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/a79ab524b1a0e576a3da67f609afc808.mp4?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMANDING CLIENTELE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the expectations of even the most demanding guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want your business to thrive, you’ll need to meet the requirements of your hotel’s clients, or you may end up with a bad reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/7a1a2864c7d48c4081fe997ab6cb0520.poster.avif?t=1777880049\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/7a1a2864c7d48c4081fe997ab6cb0520.webm?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/7a1a2864c7d48c4081fe997ab6cb0520.mp4?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have built a good reputation and developed your hotel, you will be able to hire employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These loyal staff members will assist you with cleaning the rooms, allowing you to focus on expanding your hotel and welcoming your guests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/67f91965b01617e68d4898bb91850585.poster.avif?t=1777880049\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/67f91965b01617e68d4898bb91850585.webm?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/67f91965b01617e68d4898bb91850585.mp4?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>THE MORE THE MERRIER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to three of your friends! But be careful: choose your companions wisely, they might be a great help… or not !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/e0e78cea91c63b2464e96fdeeac1cd20.poster.avif?t=1777880049\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/e0e78cea91c63b2464e96fdeeac1cd20.webm?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/extras/e0e78cea91c63b2464e96fdeeac1cd20.mp4?t=1777880049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Discover Crazy Hotel Together, a hotel management game where you and your friends have to run a rather unusual hotel! Fulfill your guests’ requests and upgrade your establishment to transform it from a low-cost hotel into a palace!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244880/0324c2b067af83ff55ef0156644aba23e5b6be00/header.jpg?t=1777880049", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.